# 📱 PhonePe Transaction Analysis Dashboard | Power BI

## 📌 Project Overview

This project is an interactive **PhonePe Transaction Analysis Dashboard developed using Microsoft Power BI**.

The dashboard focuses on analyzing digital payment and transaction data to understand **transaction trends, transaction volume, transaction value, geographical performance, and overall business growth patterns**.

The objective of this project was to transform raw transaction data into an interactive and visually appealing dashboard that can help users understand digital payment trends and derive meaningful business insights.

---

## 🎯 Project Objectives

The main objectives of this project were to:

- Analyze overall PhonePe transaction performance
- Track transaction volume and transaction value
- Identify transaction trends over time
- Compare performance across different geographical regions
- Understand state-wise transaction activity
- Identify high-performing regions
- Create interactive KPIs and visualizations
- Present complex transaction data in an easy-to-understand format

